      "widgets_values": [
        "Load your portrait and the FULL speech audio. Select model files if your paths differ. The node loops automatically through the audio at 24 fps. Context = 22; chunk_seconds includes overlap and snaps down to the H3 grid. Output audio is the original file. audio_denoise = 0 locks the source audio during sampling. Use a visual/speaking prompt; do not repeat the entire long transcript in every chunk. Optional chunk_prompts is a JSON array of per-window prompt suffixes, including overlap speech. See docs/long-audio-lipsync.md. Final IMAGE output uses CPU RAM proportional to duration. This variant needs only ComfyUI core and this Director plugin. It uses the base model with 25 steps, res_multistep/simple. "
